# 基本文章編集の文章の中の図形を、図形のウインドウへ運び出す (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py.
# A copy of 画用紙 (mkbig fig) is opened by the figure editor's process and moved by its name
# band to the lower right of the screen. A copy of 基本文章編集 whose record 0 is a text with a
# figure standing in a line (xmlbig) is opened at 100,100, and the figure carried by the hand
# out of the window onto the figure, the button let go at once. A figure carried out of a text
# is taken by no window but the text's own: the desktop's figure editor that took it is gone,
# and a program's window is given letters and links only. It is refused ("ここには置けません")
# and stays in the text, whose record 0 is then as it was before.
# Keys: Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
# The record wanted is the one before the carry (keep before): nothing leaves the text.
mkbig fig 3 1
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙
wait 500
drag 500 117 1000 412
wait 500
mkbig doc 3
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document><text lang="0" bpat="0"/>
xml <p>先頭の行です。</p>
xml <p>前<bold>太字の語</bold>と<font color="#ff0000">赤い語</font>の後</p>
xml <p>A<figure><figView left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/><figDraw left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/><rect l_pat="1" left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/></figure>B</p>
xml <p>最後の行です。</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlbig
sum
keep before
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 4
wait 800
logmark
hold 160 225
move 300 300
move 700 450
move 1000 550
up
expectsincein 10 document: figure carried out (-
wait 500
logmark
click 400 112
wait 300
sum show
same before
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
wait 500
